"In addition to the support of AOROC and the EPHE, eScriptorium has "
"benefitted from a significant number of institutions and funding sources, "
"including the following:"
msgstr ""
"Además del apoyo de AOROC y la EPHE, eScriptorium se ha beneficiado de un "
"número importante de instituciones y fuentes de financiación, entre ellas "
"las siguientes:"

#: contributors/credits_list.html contributors_example/credits_list.html
